OL,3,ATwo killed in 'violent incident' at
OL,4,Aschool near Berlin
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been killed in a
OL,7,Fviolent incident at a school in the
OL,8,Ftown of Gosen-Neu Zittau near Berlin.
OL,10,FOne of the dead is an 18-year-old
OL,11,Fsecondary school student and the other
OL,12,Fvictim is a 30-year-old man who died
OL,13,Fwhen he tried to intervene, local media
OL,14,Freported.
OL,16,FA male suspect has been arrested. It is
OL,17,Fnot yet known if he was a student at
OL,18,Fthe private Docemus school.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
